{% comment %}
  Blog index — 博客文章列表页主体（blog 模板，路由 /blogs/<handle>）。

  ## 这一页要解决的问题
  骨架版本是「标题 + 一列裸 div + default_pagination」：没有图位、没有层级、
  元信息是一句拼起来的 "date by author"，翻页是一串系统默认链接。这里把它做成
  一份**编辑型索引**：第 1 页的首篇当头条（大图 + 大标题），其余进三列网格；
  标签既是卡片元信息，也在页头生成一行可点的主题入口
  —— Shopify 博客**没有分类**，标签就是它唯一的分类法，不另造一套。

  ## 几条不能改的判断
  1. **整张卡 = 一个 `<a>`**（与 collections.liquid / blog-posts.liquid 同构）：
     全卡可点、每卡只有一个 tab 停靠点。由此推出一条硬约束 ——
     **卡内不能再有交互元素**，所以标签只能是 `<span>`（`<a>` 里套 `<a>` 非法嵌套）。
     "按标签浏览"的入口因此放在页头那行 `<a>` 里，而不是卡内。
  2. **分页，不做无限滚动**：`paginate` 是平台原生、无 JS 可用、每页有独立 URL
     （可抓取、可分享、可直落第 2 页）。无限滚动要自己拼 URL、自己管焦点、
     还要给爬虫留静态副本——成本全在顾客看不见的地方，收益只是"少点一次"。
  3. **头条只出现在第 1 页**：第 2 页起网格从头开始，翻页后版式不"跳层"。
  4. **图位恒定存在**：没有封面的文章用 icon-leaf 占位（与 blog-posts / 搜索页
     同一套视觉语言）。否则纯文字卡夹在图文卡中间会把网格切碎，
     而且行高会参差。
  5. **元信息只放真实字段**：`published_at` / `author` / 标签 / 由正文词数算出的
     阅读时长。不造"浏览量""热度"这类平台根本不提供的数据。

  ## 阅读时长口径
  `article.content | strip_html | number_of_words` ÷ 200 词/分钟，向上取整。
  200wpm 是英文技术读物的常用口径。词数为 0（只写了摘要、正文为空）时整段不渲染，
  而不是硬凑一个 "1 min read"。

  ## 响应式
  < 750px：单列，头条图 16:10；≥ 750px：两列网格 + 头条左右分栏；
  ≥ 990px：三列网格。头条的图在 ≥ 750px 用 `block-size: 100%` 跟着文字列走
  —— 让文字决定卡高，三行标题换两行时图自己裁，卡片不会忽高忽矮。

  ## 配色纪律
  全部从 `--color-*` 派生（color-mix），Noir 预设自动翻转；hover 走上浮
  `--card-hover-lift` + `--card-hover-shadow` 全站签名。
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign per_page = section.settings.articles_per_page | default: 8
  assign show_featured = section.settings.show_featured
  assign show_excerpt = section.settings.show_excerpt
  assign show_author = section.settings.show_author
  assign show_reading_time = section.settings.show_reading_time
  assign show_card_tags = section.settings.show_card_tags
  assign show_topic_nav = section.settings.show_topic_nav

  # sizes 提示按实际列数写：三列时单卡约 30vw，两列 45vw，单列铺满内容列（≈92vw）
  assign card_sizes = '(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 750px) 45vw, 92vw'
  # 头条图在 ≥750px 占分栏的一半多一点（1.05fr / 2）
  assign lead_sizes = '(min-width: 750px) 52vw, 92vw'
-%}

<div class="blog-index__hero full-width">
  <div class="blog-index__hero-inner">
    <nav class="blog-index__breadcrumb" aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.breadcrumb_label' | t }}">
      <ol class="blog-index__breadcrumb-list" role="list">
        <li class="blog-index__breadcrumb-item">
          <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'blog.list.breadcrumb_home' | t }}</a>
        </li>
        <li class="blog-index__breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page">
          {{ blog.title | escape }}
        </li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="blog-index__title">{{ blog.title | escape }}</h1>

    {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <p class="blog-index__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      标签页（/blogs/<handle>/tagged/<tag>）走的是同一个模板，页头不交代就会被
      当成"列表没变"。这里有 current_tags 就补一行说明；清除入口是下面的
      "All guides" 药丸，不另设按钮。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if current_tags != blank -%}
      <p class="blog-index__filter-note">
        {{- 'blog.list.filtered_by' | t }}
        <strong>{{ current_tags | join: ', ' }}</strong>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      主题行：读 blog.all_tags（全局标签，与当前页无关），封顶 8 个。
      再多就不像"入口"而像"标签云"，也会在 375px 上折三行把首篇挤下去。
      tag URL 必须 handleize —— 标签原文带空格/大小写，直接拼会和平台不匹配。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if show_topic_nav and blog.all_tags.size > 0 -%}
      <nav class="blog-index__topics" aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.topics_label' | t }}">
        <a
          class="blog-index__topic{% if current_tags == blank %} is-active{% endif %}"
          href="{{ blog.url }}"
          {% if current_tags == blank %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}
        >
          {{- 'blog.list.all_topics' | t -}}
        </a>
        {%- for tag in blog.all_tags limit: 8 -%}
          <a
            class="blog-index__topic{% if current_tags contains tag %} is-active{% endif %}"
            href="{{ blog.url }}/tagged/{{ tag | handleize }}"
            {% if current_tags contains tag %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}
          >
            {{- tag -}}
          </a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="blog-index__page">
  {%- paginate blog.articles by per_page -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      头条判定收在这里：paginate.current_page 只在 paginate 块内可用；
      articles_count 是博客总数（paginate 块内 blog.articles 已被切片成当前页）。
      只剩一篇时不升头条 —— 一张大卡旁边空着三列网格比一张普通卡更难看。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign lead = blank
      if show_featured and paginate.current_page == 1 and blog.articles_count > 1
        assign lead = blog.articles.first
      endif
    -%}

    {%- if lead != blank -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign lead_words = lead.content | strip_html | number_of_words
        assign lead_minutes = lead_words | divided_by: 200.0 | ceil | at_least: 1
        assign lead_tag = lead.tags.first
      -%}
      <article class="blog-index__featured" data-reveal>
        <a class="blog-index__featured-card" href="{{ lead.url }}">
          <span class="blog-index__featured-media">
            {%- if lead.image != blank -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                alt 留空：同一链接内已有标题文字，再念一遍封面 alt 是重复。
                image_tag 在 alt 为空时会把属性整条吞掉（不是输出 alt=""），
                所以 capture 后补一次，否则 Lighthouse 判缺 alt。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- capture lead_image -%}
                {{
                  lead.image
                  | image_url: width: 1400
                  | image_tag:
                    widths: '500, 750, 1000, 1400',
                    sizes: lead_sizes,
                    width: lead.image.width,
                    height: lead.image.height,
                    loading: 'eager',
                    fetchpriority: 'high',
                    alt: ''
                }}
              {%- endcapture -%}
              {%- unless lead_image contains ' alt=' -%}
                {%- assign lead_image = lead_image | replace: '<img ', '<img alt="" ' -%}
              {%- endunless -%}
              {{ lead_image }}
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="blog-index__placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>

          <div class="blog-index__featured-body">
            {%- if show_card_tags and lead_tag != blank -%}
              <p class="blog-index__eyebrow">{{ lead_tag }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            <h2 class="blog-index__featured-title">{{ lead.title | escape }}</h2>

            {%- if show_excerpt -%}
              {%- if lead.excerpt != blank -%}
                <p class="blog-index__featured-excerpt">
                  {{- lead.excerpt | strip_html | truncatewords: 40 -}}
                </p>
              {%- elsif lead.content != blank -%}
                <p class="blog-index__featured-excerpt">
                  {{- lead.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 40 -}}
                </p>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            <div class="blog-index__featured-footer">
              <p class="blog-index__meta">
                {{ lead.published_at | time_tag: format: 'date' }}
                {%- if show_author and lead.author != blank -%}
                  <span class="blog-index__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>{{ lead.author | escape }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if show_reading_time and lead_words > 0 -%}
                  <span class="blog-index__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>{{ 'blog.list.reading_time' | t: count: lead_minutes }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </p>
              <span class="blog-index__featured-cta">{{ 'blog.list.read_article' | t }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if blog.articles_count > 0 -%}
      <ul class="blog-index__grid" role="list">
        {%- for article in blog.articles -%}
          {%- comment -%} 被选作头条的那篇不再进网格（按 handle 比对，不按下标） {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if lead != blank and article.handle == lead.handle -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign words = article.content | strip_html | number_of_words
            assign minutes = words | divided_by: 200.0 | ceil | at_least: 1
            # 入场延迟封顶 360ms：8 张卡按 60ms 递增会排到 480ms，越往下越像卡住
            assign reveal_delay = forloop.index0 | times: 60 | at_most: 360
          -%}
          <li class="blog-index__item" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: {{ reveal_delay }}ms">
            <a class="blog-index__card" href="{{ article.url }}">
              <span class="blog-index__media">
                {%- if article.image != blank -%}
                  {%- capture card_image -%}
                    {{
                      article.image
                      | image_url: width: 800
                      | image_tag:
                        widths: '320, 480, 640, 800',
                        sizes: card_sizes,
                        width: article.image.width,
                        height: article.image.height,
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        alt: ''
                    }}
                  {%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- unless card_image contains ' alt=' -%}
                    {%- assign card_image = card_image | replace: '<img ', '<img alt="" ' -%}
                  {%- endunless -%}
                  {{ card_image }}
                {%- else -%}
                  <span class="blog-index__placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>

              {%- comment -%}
                body 用 div 而不是 span：h2 / p 是流内容，塞进 span 是非法嵌套。
                `<a>` 的内容模型是 transparent，装 div + h2 合法（与集合卡同结构），
                标题保留 h2 语义 —— 读屏可以按标题快跳各篇。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="blog-index__body">
                <p class="blog-index__meta">
                  {{ article.published_at | time_tag: format: 'date' }}
                  {%- if show_author and article.author != blank -%}
                    <span class="blog-index__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                    <span>{{ article.author | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if show_reading_time and words > 0 -%}
                    <span class="blog-index__meta-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                    <span>{{ 'blog.list.reading_time' | t: count: minutes }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </p>

                <h2 class="blog-index__card-title">{{ article.title | escape }}</h2>

                {%- if show_excerpt -%}
                  {%- if article.excerpt != blank -%}
                    <p class="blog-index__excerpt">
                      {{- article.excerpt | strip_html | truncatewords: 22 -}}
                    </p>
                  {%- elsif article.content != blank -%}
                    <p class="blog-index__excerpt">
                      {{- article.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 22 -}}
                    </p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- comment -%}
                  标签钉在卡底（margin-block-start: auto）：同排卡片标签行落在同一
                  基线上，标题行数不同也不参差。封顶 3 个 —— 一篇打 8 个标签的
                  文章会把这行折成三行，卡高全靠它撑着。只能是 span，见文件头说明。
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if show_card_tags and article.tags.size > 0 -%}
                  <span class="blog-index__tags">
                    {%- for tag in article.tags limit: 3 -%}
                      <span class="blog-index__tag">{{ tag }}</span>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        空态：博客还没发文章（装完主题的空店就是这种状态）。
        页面照常渲染，不留白屏，并给一条离开这个页面的路。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="blog-index__empty">
        <p class="blog-index__empty-title">{{ 'blog.list.empty.title' | t }}</p>
        <p class="blog-index__empty-body">{{ 'blog.list.empty.body' | t }}</p>
        <a class="blog-index__empty-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
          {{- 'blog.list.empty.link' | t -}}
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        分页：与集合页 / 集合列表页同一套圆形按钮。箭头恒在 —— 不可用方向渲染
        禁用占位，行宽不跳；中间截断部分渲染成 … 间隔（aria-hidden，纯视觉）。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <nav class="blog-index__pagination" aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.pagination_label' | t }}">
        {%- if paginate.previous -%}
          <a
            class="blog-index__pagination-nav"
            href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.pagination_previous' | t }}"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="blog-index__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- for part in paginate.parts -%}
          {%- if part.is_link -%}
            <a
              class="blog-index__pagination-page"
              href="{{ part.url }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.page_number' | t: number: part.title }}"
            >{{ part.title }}</a>
          {%- elsif part.title == paginate.current_page -%}
            <span class="blog-index__pagination-page" aria-current="page">{{ part.title }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="blog-index__pagination-gap" aria-hidden="true">{{ part.title }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- if paginate.next -%}
          <a
            class="blog-index__pagination-nav"
            href="{{ paginate.next.url }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'blog.list.pagination_next' | t }}"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="blog-index__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endpaginate -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ============================================================
     博客文章列表页 /blogs/<handle>

     版式与 /collections 同源：页头淡品牌色带 + 内容列，卡片 = 白底 +
     1px 细边 + 12px 圆角，hover 走全站签名（上浮 + 浅绿光晕）。
     区别在于这里是**编辑型索引**，多一层文字优先级：
       头条（第 1 页首篇）→ 大图 + 大标题，是全页唯一的视觉重心；
       网格卡 → 图 4:3 + 日期/阅读时长 + 标题 + 摘要 + 标签。

     布局分工（与 collections.liquid 完全一致）：
       .blog-index__hero → full-width 通栏（背景带铺满视口）
       .blog-index__page → .shopify-section 网格的第 2 列（内容列）
     hero 内层 max-inline-size: var(--content-width) 收回内容列，
     两块左边缘因此严格对齐。
     ============================================================ */

  /* ---------- 页头带 ---------- */

  .blog-index__hero {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-background) 94%, var(--color-brand) 6%);
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-index__hero-inner {
    max-inline-size: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem) clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  /* 面包屑：与集合页同一口径。链接给 44px 触控高度，所以用 align-items: center
     让两行文字居中对齐，而不是把基线拉歪。 */
  .blog-index__breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-index__breadcrumb-item + .blog-index__breadcrumb-item::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-inline-end: 0.35rem;
  }
  .blog-index__breadcrumb-item a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .blog-index__breadcrumb-item a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .blog-index__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .blog-index__subheading {
    margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
    max-inline-size: 58ch;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  /* 标签页说明行：只在 /tagged/<x> 出现，位置贴着副标题，不抢 h1 */
  .blog-index__filter-note {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .blog-index__filter-note strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
  }

  /* ---------- 主题（标签）行 ---------- */

  .blog-index__topics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
  }
  /* 40px 高：低于分页按钮的 44px，因为这是一排并列的次级入口，
     44px 会把页头带顶到两行以上；40px 仍在移动端可点范围内。 */
  .blog-index__topic {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 40px;
    padding-inline: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 82%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .blog-index__topic:hover {
      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 45%, transparent);
      color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    }
  }
  .blog-index__topic:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .blog-index__topic.is-active {
    border-color: transparent;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* ---------- 内容区 ---------- */

  .blog-index__page {
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  /* ---------- 头条（第 1 页首篇） ---------- */

  .blog-index__featured {
    margin-block-end: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
  }
  .blog-index__featured-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    /* 用 translate 而非 transform：滚动入场的 animation 也用 transform
       （critical.css 的 reveal-in），两套机制互不抢占。 */
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, translate 0.2s ease;
  }
  .blog-index__featured-card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .blog-index__featured-media {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
  }

  .blog-index__featured-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.75rem);
  }
  .blog-index__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
  }
  .blog-index__featured-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.3vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    /* break-word：窄栏里 "Walk-behind mowers" 这类词不能被拆断 */
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .blog-index__featured-excerpt {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  /* 分隔线 + margin-block-start: auto：元信息与 CTA 一起钉在文字列底部，
     图比文字高时不会在下方留一条空带。 */
  .blog-index__featured-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: 0.85rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 8%, transparent);
  }
  /* 全页只此一处箭头（AGENTS §6：卡内文字链接不加箭头，新增箭头先数同屏总数）。
     头条是全页唯一的主 CTA，arrow 留给它做强调。 */
  .blog-index__featured-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
  }
  .blog-index__featured-cta::after {
    content: '\2192';
    transition: translate 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* ---------- 网格 ---------- */

  .blog-index__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .blog-index__grid {
      /* minmax(0, 1fr)：长标题的 min-content 不能把轨道撑出视口 */
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .blog-index__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .blog-index__item {
    display: flex;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .blog-index__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, translate 0.2s ease;
  }
  .blog-index__card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* 媒体盒：4:3 定比 + 图绝对定位铺满。图若留在流里，固有宽高比会参与
     grid 行高计算（use-case-grid 7:3→5:5 的教训），同排卡片会被拉得忽高忽矮。
     为什么是 4:3：博客封面多是实拍横图，4:3 只裁两侧；1:1 会把横图裁掉近一半。
     对照 /collections 的 1:1 —— 那里回落的是商品方图，理由相反。 */
  .blog-index__media {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-index__media img,
  .blog-index__featured-media img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
  }
  /* 缺图占位：图标本身放在绝对定位层里居中，图位恒定存在、大小一致 */
  .blog-index__placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-index__placeholder svg {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
  }

  .blog-index__body {
    display: flex;
    /* flex: 1 必须有：卡片被 grid 拉到等高后，多出来的高度默认留在 body 之外，
       标签行（margin-block-start: auto）就钉不到卡底。 */
    flex: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem 0.95rem;
  }

  /* 元信息：日期 · 阅读时长。压在标题**上方**——编辑型索引的常规读法
     （先看"什么时候、多久"，再看标题值不值得点）。 */
  .blog-index__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .blog-index__meta-sep {
    /* 圆点比字符更轻，且不会被读屏念成"中间点" */
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 35%, transparent);
  }

  .blog-index__card-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .blog-index__excerpt {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  .blog-index__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: 0.6rem;
  }
  .blog-index__tag {
    padding: 0.16rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- 悬停（只在真有指针的设备上：触屏 :hover 会粘住） ---------- */

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover,
    .blog-index__card:hover {
      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 40%, transparent);
      box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
      translate: 0 var(--card-hover-lift);
    }
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover .blog-index__featured-media img,
    .blog-index__card:hover .blog-index__media img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
    .blog-index__card:hover .blog-index__card-title {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
      text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 45%, transparent);
    }
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover .blog-index__featured-cta::after {
      translate: 0.2rem 0;
    }
  }

  /* ---------- 空态 ---------- */

  .blog-index__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 20%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .blog-index__empty-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .blog-index__empty-body {
    margin: 0;
    max-inline-size: 42ch;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .blog-index__empty-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-block-start: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* ---------- 分页（与集合页 / 集合列表页同一套视觉） ---------- */

  .blog-index__pagination {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
  }
  .blog-index__pagination-nav,
  .blog-index__pagination-page {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .blog-index__pagination a:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 40%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-index__pagination [aria-disabled='true'] {
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
  .blog-index__pagination [aria-current='page'] {
    border-color: transparent;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .blog-index__pagination-gap {
    min-width: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 45%, transparent);
  }

  /* ---------- 断点：头条左右分栏 + 卡片放大 ---------- */

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .blog-index__featured-card {
      /* 图略宽于文字：封面是这一层的信息主体，文字列负责标题与摘要的节奏 */
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    }
    .blog-index__featured-media {
      /* 让文字列决定卡高，图跟着填满（min-block-size 保住最低视觉分量）。
         反过来用 aspect-ratio 定高的话，标题三行→两行时整卡会忽高忽矮。 */
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      block-size: 100%;
      min-block-size: 17rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .blog-index__featured-card,
    .blog-index__card,
    .blog-index__media img,
    .blog-index__featured-media img,
    .blog-index__topic {
      transition: none;
    }
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover,
    .blog-index__card:hover {
      translate: none;
    }
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover .blog-index__featured-media img,
    .blog-index__card:hover .blog-index__media img {
      transform: none;
    }
    .blog-index__featured-card:hover .blog-index__featured-cta::after {
      translate: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.blog",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "blog-index-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "t:labels.subheading",
      "default": "Field notes on choosing, running and maintaining outdoor power equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "articles_per_page",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 4,
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.articles_per_page",
      "info": "t:sections.blog.labels.articles_per_page_info",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_featured",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_featured",
      "info": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_featured_info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_topic_nav",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_topic_nav",
      "info": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_topic_nav_info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_excerpt",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_excerpt",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_author",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_author",
      "info": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_author_info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_reading_time",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_reading_time",
      "info": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_reading_time_info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_card_tags",
      "label": "t:sections.blog.labels.show_card_tags",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
